        <span from="55:6" to="56:8"/>
        <comment>hamichlol gives the Fast of Gedalia its own entry, in which Morocco and Algeria read Dirshu with Ashkenaz and Italki -- 'א, איט, חלק מסמג (בעיקר מרוקו ואלג'יריה)' -- rather than the Hosea reading they have on the other public fasts.</comment>
